	(text "Right-half rows are hard-wired to D0–D3, the only common ADC pads on every XIAO Plus. \nThe left half of each row goes through a jumper (JP1–JP4): tie it to the right half on XIAO nRF52840 and RP2040 Plus, \nor give it its own pins on the SAMD21 (D7–D10), which has more ADC input pins to half the amount of electrodes on each sense line to get a cleaner signal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.634 31.496 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "599fe9c9-bffb-48c8-a001-45592b179441")
	)
